Error [E0617]: `.expect_fail` takes an optional runtime stop code and `message: "text"`
  --> tests/ui/scope_expect_fail_empty_message.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |     .expect_fail(message: "") {
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the code names a registered E30xx stop; the message is a non-empty string literal matched as a case-sensitive substring
 Fix: write `.expect_fail { … }`, `.expect_fail(E3010) { … }`, or `.expect_fail(E3001, message: "reason") { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0617
